# Tests with every feature

When adding or changing product behavior (issue, endpoint, domain rule, Android screen, Gateway route), follow `.cursor/skills/write-feature-tests/SKILL.md`.

Do not open a PR or call the work done without automated tests for the new behavior, plus at least one rejection/edge case when the story has a "no puedo / si falta" rule.

Skip only for docs, comments, or config/Dockerfile edits with no runtime change.

```
// ❌ BAD — feature merged with no tests
public decimal Cachet { get; set; }

// ✅ GOOD — acceptance criterion has a named test
[Fact]
public void Event_loop_publish_list_apply_accept_reject_with_visible_cachet() { ... }
```
